ribes melodic/harmonic features that occur *within* the swing framework, Choice B describes the foundational rhythmic structure that *creates* the swing feel.\n\nTherefore, Choice B provides the most fundamental description of how the swing rhythm is established in the audio.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{B}$
